{"id":"8da4d48c64fe9588","group":"72","path":"72/72-meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit.md","title":"meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit — Supplied historical-summary record","display":"meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit — Supplied historical-summary record","type":"source-record","metadata":{"type":"source-record","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit","aliases":["72-meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit"],"display":"meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit — Supplied historical-summary record","depends_on":[],"source_kind":"local-reconstruction-from-supplied-summary","verification_status":"explicit-local-data-and-interface-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"reconstructed":"2026-10-24"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"source-record"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"meta-revision-2026-10-23-source-audit — Supplied historical-summary record"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-reconstruction-from-supplied-summary"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"explicit-local-data-and-interface-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"reconstructed","html":"2026-10-24"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb S:=\\{0,\\ldots,127\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb S:=\\{0,\\ldots,127\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是 ASCII 有限字符串集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\mathtt{s}\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\mathtt{s}\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示显示字面串的字符编码序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb S\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下列有限数据表完整编码附件现存正文“历史：2026-10-23载体与来源复核”中声称的计数。各字段表示“该摘要记录的数字”，不是本次文件实际数量、已完成审阅次数或证明资格。表格字面数据是本定义的全部输入，不读取缺失报告或 Remark。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72}\">\\(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72}\\)</span> 为下式给出的字符串—自然数关系；计数函数只在该关系的定义域上取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72}:=\\{&amp;\n\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{baseline-markdown}\\urcorner,580\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{registered-entries}\\urcorner,575\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{content-entries}\\urcorner,570\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{changed-content}\\urcorner,7\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{carrier-completions}\\urcorner,3\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{dependency-registrations}\\urcorner,4\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{updated-index-and-navigation}\\urcorner,10\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{new-report}\\urcorner,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-markdown-after}\\urcorner,581\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{missing-old-reports}\\urcorner,5\\rangle\n\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72}:=\\{&amp;\n\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{baseline-markdown}\\urcorner,580\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{registered-entries}\\urcorner,575\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{content-entries}\\urcorner,570\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{changed-content}\\urcorner,7\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{carrier-completions}\\urcorner,3\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{dependency-registrations}\\urcorner,4\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{updated-index-and-navigation}\\urcorner,10\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{new-report}\\urcorner,1\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-markdown-after}\\urcorner,581\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{missing-old-reports}\\urcorner,5\\rangle\n\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72}\\subseteq\\mathbb S\\times\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})=\\{k\\in\\mathbb S:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72}\\subseteq\\mathbb S\\times\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})=\\{k\\in\\mathbb S:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecordedCount}_{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}(k):=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})\\quad(k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RecordedCount}_{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}(k):=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})\\quad(k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{sourceaudit}}_{72})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6c99e2646691c7d\" href=\"?note=e6c99e2646691c7d\" title=\"72-df-book-catalog\">72-df-book-catalog</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa9c9e25ba49583\" href=\"?note=6aa9c9e25ba49583\" title=\"72-df-navigation-index\">72-df-navigation-index</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d85a6a31705a214\" href=\"?note=4d85a6a31705a214\" title=\"72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC\">72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC</a> 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。</p>\n<p>原摘要记载：7 个内容文件的修改由 3 个载体补全和 4 个直接依赖登记组成；并称同步了 10 个目录或术语文件、新增 1 份报告。附件没有给出这 7 个文件的完整逐项名单或当时的校验材料，因此这里不猜补名单、页码和证明记录。</p>\n<p>表中键互异，每个键恰有一个自然数值，因此计数函数在其显式定义域上存在且唯一。历史声称中的文件数量可能与本次附件基线不同；两者不能混用。本文件不充当任何数学定理的证明依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-book-catalog","status":"resolved","id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 [[72-df-book-catalog]]、[[72-df-navigation-index]] 和 [[72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC]] 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-navigation-index","status":"resolved","id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 [[72-df-book-catalog]]、[[72-df-navigation-index]] 和 [[72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC]] 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。","embed":false},{"target":"72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 [[72-df-book-catalog]]、[[72-df-navigation-index]] 和 [[72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC]] 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb S:=\\{0,\\ldots,127\\}^{<\\omega}"